{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "d32b1e26-c2eb-8672-82ec-49785df9e880",
  "created_at": "2026-01-29T10:10:15-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Liam Flynn",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T10:03:51-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T10:03:55-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi Denise, Liam Flynn calling. I'm up on the Hill, and I got a road here that's a sheet of ice. Needs sand or salt, one or the other."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T10:04:13-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I can help with that. What street are you on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T10:04:21-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ruggles Avenue. I'm at 217 Ruggles."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T10:04:26-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "217 Ruggles, got it. Is this left over from the storm earlier in the week?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T10:04:36-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that snow-to-rain thing that ended Monday. Three days ago now. Plow came through, sure, got the snow off. Then it rained, then everything froze solid overnight. Now it's glass out there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T10:04:56-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, that refreeze has been rough. Is it the whole block or just a stretch?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T10:05:06-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hang on one second, I got my hands in flour. [pause] Sorry. I'm making sourdough and I keep having to go check the dough. It's got to be folded every half hour or so."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T10:05:28-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, go ahead. I'm typing this up while you do."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T10:05:36-05:00",
      "duration": 29,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'm back. So, the whole block, really. Worst part is the slope right in front of my place, where it heads down toward the cross street. Cars are sliding sideways on it. I watched a delivery van do a slow spin about an hour ago."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T10:06:05-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh boy. Anybody hurt, any cars hit?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T10:06:10-05:00",
      "duration": 23,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, not yet. But that's my point, it's gonna happen. I'd like some sand down on it, honestly. Salt's fine too, but sand gives you grip right away, and it's cold enough that salt's not doing much."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T10:06:33-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fair enough. I'll put in a request for sand at 217 Ruggles Avenue, on the hill section by the cross street. Do you know which cross street it is?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T10:06:51-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's the one down by the corner, the little one. Honestly I always just say down the bottom of the hill. If your crew comes up from Bellevue they'll see it, it's the steepest bit."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T10:07:13-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, steep stretch of Ruggles coming up from Bellevue. That'll work for the crew."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T10:07:22-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Because I called Tuesday too, I think it was my neighbor who did, and I figured they'd be around by now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T10:07:36-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm not seeing anything on that yet from my screen, but there may be a request under a different spelling. I'll add yours and note that it's been a few days of ice."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T10:07:57-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Appreciate that. I'm not trying to be difficult. It's just, three days for ice, you know?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T10:08:08-05:00",
      "duration": 25,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. After a storm like this the crews work the main roads first, then the hills and side streets. Ruggles is on the list, it just comes later. I'll flag it as a hazard so it moves up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T10:08:33-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Any idea when, today, tomorrow?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T10:08:38-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'd say today or tomorrow morning is realistic. Today if they get through the hill streets this afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T10:08:50-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Hold on, the timer's going off. [pause] Sorry, that's the oven preheating. Go on."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T10:09:00-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No worries. Do you want a callback number in case dispatch needs to reach you about the location?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T10:09:12-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. It's 401-555-0182."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T10:09:15-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0182, and that's Liam, last name Flynn?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T10:09:20-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "F-L-Y-N-N, yeah."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T10:09:22-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. So I've got sand requested, 217 Ruggles Avenue, the steep section by the cross street, icy road after the storm."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T10:09:36-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. And tell them the sidewalk's no better, but I know that's not you guys. I'll just do my own with the bag of stuff in the shed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T10:09:54-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, sidewalks are on the property owner, but I appreciate that. Be careful out there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T10:10:04-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Will do. Thanks, Denise. I gotta go fold this dough."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T10:10:11-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Enjoy the bread. Bye now."
    }
  ],
